  "_comment": "V5 Iter6 (Loss V3): aggressive q50-as-production loss redesign. Drop utility_rank (no rank-by-q10 negative bias, redundant with Pearson on q50). Add Huber on q50 directly (magnitude + bias correction via mean target). Add Pearson on q50 directly (continuous IC, scale-invariant). Keep pinball at 0.3 weight only for q10/q90 uncertainty preservation. Theoretical: matches FactorNet IJCAI 2024 paradigm — production uses q50, loss directly supervises q50 on both magnitude (Huber) and rank (IC). Drops utility_rank as it's redundant + had structural bias.",
